w_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;Tranh l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m h\u1ecda s\u0129 v\u1ebd hoa sen&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=4139","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":3646,"name":"Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 d\u1ec7t d\u00e0y &#8211; 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m nh\u1eb9 tho\u00e1ng","slug":"khan-to-det-day-100-to-tam-nhe-thoang","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/khan-to-det-day-100-to-tam-nhe-thoang\/","sku":"","short_description":"<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p R\u1ef1c R\u1ee1 C\u1ee7a <strong>Kh\u0103n T\u01a1<\/strong> Ombre Hanhsilk D\u01b0\u1edbi \u00c1nh N\u1eafng<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 s\u1ef1 quy\u1ebfn r\u0169 c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Hanhsilk, n\u01a1i m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng. V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, kh\u0103n t\u1ea1o hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng b\u1eaft m\u1eaft, s\u00e1ng b\u00f3ng v\u00e0 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 khi \u0111i d\u01b0\u1edbi n\u1eafng, \u0111em l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u01b0\u01a1i m\u1edbi v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat m\u1ecdi \u00e1nh nh\u00ecn.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Hanhsilk &#8211; m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi cho nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ebfn \u0111i<\/div>\n<\/div>","description":"<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<p data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"586\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 Hanhsilk:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<li data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"603\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. \u1ea4m v\u00e0o m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng, m\u00e1t m\u1ebb v\u00e0o m\u00f9a h\u00e8, nh\u1eb9 tho\u00e1ng<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"933\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"707\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% d\u1ec7t b\u00e1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng n\u00ean c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng, m\u1ecbn, \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn d\u00e0y d\u1eb7n gi\u00fap cho b\u1ea1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt gi\u1eefa \u0111\u00e1m \u0111\u00f4ng.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1073\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"962\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong>\u00a0S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n trong nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt m\u1ecdi phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1088\">\u0110a n\u0103ng:<\/strong>\u00a0Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c sang tr\u1ecdng, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 80*200cm<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs 