e0 t\u1eb7ng: Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 \u00f3ng \u1ea3, kh\u1ea9u trang v\u00e0 d\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c","slug":"set-qua-tang-8-3-khan-to-ong-a-khau-trang-va-day-buoc-toc","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/set-qua-tang-8-3-khan-to-ong-a-khau-trang-va-day-buoc-toc\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"603\">B\u1ed9 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 &#8211; Y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng tinh t\u1ebf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"603\">(\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 24\/02-08\/03)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"526\"><strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"390\">Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 \u00f3ng \u1ea3<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u0169 tinh t\u1ebf. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"595\"><strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"553\">Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> \u00eam \u00e1i, tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"686\"><strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"617\">D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c l\u1ee5a<\/strong> gi\u00fap h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf g\u00e3y r\u1ee5ng, gi\u1eef t\u00f3c m\u1ec1m m\u01b0\u1ee3t v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Set \u0111\u00e3 bao g\u1ed3m h\u1ed9p v\u00e0 t\u00fai l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng. Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn kh\u0103n v\u00e0 v\u00f2ng vui l\u00f2ng IB ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eafn tin Zalo\/ Hotline: 098 596 98 64<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"117\">Set Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 \u2013 Set y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng tinh t\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"217\">M\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng thanh l\u1ecbch d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"235\"><strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"235\">Set bao g\u1ed3m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"316\">\n<li data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"256\">\n<p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"256\">01 Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 \u00f3ng \u1ea3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 80*200cm<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"285\">\n<p data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"285\">01 Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1edbn t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"316\">\n<p data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"316\">01 D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"321\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"371\">\u2728 M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u2013 Nh\u1eb9 tho\u00e1ng \u2013 Thanh l\u1ecbch m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"526\"><strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"390\">Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 \u00f3ng \u1ea3<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u0169 tinh t\u1ebf. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"595\"><strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"553\">Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> \u00eam \u00e1i, tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"686\"><strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"617\">D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c l\u1ee5a<\/strong> gi\u00fap h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf g\u00e3y r\u1ee5ng, gi\u1eef t\u00f3c m\u1ec1m m\u01b0\u1ee3t v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"788\">T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"904\">\ud83c\udf81 Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 cho m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u01a1ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef.<br data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"862\" \/>\ud83c\udf3f \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t: Gi\u1ea3m ngay 10% cho Set. (\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 24\/02-08\/03)<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1100000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,100,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3633,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/02\/z7555790071732_564da458a0df7c802c6a83d131f759f7.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/02\/z7555790071732_564da458a0df7c802c6a83d131f759f7-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/02\/z7555790071732_564da458a0df7c802c6a83d131f759f7.jpg 1440w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/02\/z7555790071732_564da458a0df7c802c6a83d131f759f7-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/02\/z7555790071732_564da458a0df7c802c6a83d131f759f7-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/u