\/0BEC0748-CCBD-47EA-8DB0-C1F1B9A4CF0D.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/0BEC0748-CCBD-47EA-8DB0-C1F1B9A4CF0D-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/0BEC0748-CCBD-47EA-8DB0-C1F1B9A4CF0D.png 494w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/0BEC0748-CCBD-47EA-8DB0-C1F1B9A4CF0D-198x300.png 198w","sizes":"(max-width: 494px) 100vw, 494px","name":"{0BEC0748-CCBD-47EA-8DB0-C1F1B9A4CF0D}","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":152,"name":"\u00c1o d\u00e0i n\u1eef","slug":"ao-dai-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/ao-dai-nu\/"},{"id":80,"name":"Th\u1eddi trang n\u1eef","slug":"thoi-trang-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/"}],"tags":[{"id":119,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i","slug":"ao-dai-dui","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-dui\/"},{"id":343,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i t\u1ebft","slug":"ao-dai-tet","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-tet\/"},{"id":344,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i th\u00eau","slug":"ao-dai-theu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-theu\/"},{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":37,"name":"t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/to-tam-100\/"},{"id":181,"name":"v\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"vai-dui-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-dui-cao-cap\/"},{"id":345,"name":"v\u1ea3i may \u00e1o d\u00e0i","slug":"vai-may-ao-dai","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-may-ao-dai\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;\u00c1o d\u00e0i ng\u0169 th\u00e2n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=3417","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":3412,"name":"\u00c1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau hoa sen","slug":"ao-dai-dui-to-tam-hoa-tiet-theu-hoa-sen","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ao-dai-dui-to-tam-hoa-tiet-theu-hoa-sen\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m th\u00eau hoa sen n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u. Phom d\u00e1ng chu\u1ea9n m\u1ef1c, ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf, t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdn v\u1ebb \u0111oan trang v\u00e0 kh\u00ed ch\u1ea5t \u0111i\u1ec1m t\u0129nh. N\u1ec1n \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean mang s\u1eafc tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 thanh khi\u1ebft, nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ee9ng v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 kh\u00f4ng b\u00f3ng b\u1ea9y, kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, nh\u01b0ng c\u00e0ng nh\u00ecn c\u00e0ng th\u1ea5y tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p>Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n v\u1ea3i m\u1ed9c \u1ea5y, hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00eau tay ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng m\u0169i ch\u1ec9 nh\u1ecf, \u0111\u1ec1u v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. Sen hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, thanh tho\u00e1t, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y d\u1ee5ng \u00fd bi\u1ec3u tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 thanh cao, thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 b\u1ea3n l\u0129nh n\u1ed9i t\u00e2m. M\u1ed7i chi ti\u1ebft th\u00eau l\u00e0 k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi gian, tay ngh\u1ec1 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn, khi\u1ebfn chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p>Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o d\u00e0i n\u00e0y n\u1eb1m \u1edf c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c khi kho\u00e1c l\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi: m\u1ed9t v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p l\u1ecbch thi\u1ec7p, ch\u00edn ch\u1eafn v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng theo th\u1eddi gian. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t tuy\u00ean ng\u00f4n th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 m\u00ecnh l\u00e0 ai, v\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb x\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"760\">Chi\u1ebfc <strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"186\">\u00e1o d\u00e0i l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao \u2013 Hanhsilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 k\u1ebft tinh c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"230\">90 ng\u00e0y lao \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9<\/strong> v\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"263\">h\u01a1n 20 c\u00f4ng \u0111o\u1ea1n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> kh\u1eaft khe, b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb tr\u1ed3ng d\u00e2u, nu\u00f4i t\u1eb1m, k\u00e9o s\u1ee3i cho \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ec7t v\u1ea3i, nhu\u1ed9m v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n.<br data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"354\" \/>M\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ee5a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f4i tay l\u00e0nh ngh\u1ec1 c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n g\u1eafn b\u00f3 tr\u1ecdn \u0111\u1eddi v\u1edbi l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1.<br data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"473\" \/>Ch\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i m\u1ed9c m\u1ea1c nh\u01b0ng tinh t\u1ebf, tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da v\u00e0 mang h\u01a1i th\u1edf c\u1ee7a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<br data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"575\" \/>T\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng kim, n\u1ebfp v\u1ea3i tr\u00ean t\u00e0 \u00e1o l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh cho di s\u1ea3n v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"674\" \/>Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c, \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"759\">m\u1ed9t gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kho\u00e1c l\u00ean h\u00ecnh h\u00e0i \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u00c1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau hoa sen<\/p>\n<p>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: \u0110\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, k\u00e9o tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/p>\n<p>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: Tr\u1eafng<\/p>\n<p>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft: Th\u00eau hoa sen, ch\u00e2n v\u1ea1t<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 Inbox h\u1eb7c gh\u00e9 th\u0103m Hanhsilk \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn v\u1ea3i, may \u0111o theo s\u1ed1 \u0111o kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"4900000","regular_price":"4900000","sale_price":"4900000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">4,900,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3413,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/EA5DDD10-B9AE-440E-8358-6FF645B5F3C3.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/EA5DDD10-B9AE-440E-8358-6FF645B5F3C3-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/EA5DDD10-B9AE-440E-8358-6FF645B5F3C3.png 498w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2026\/01\/EA5DDD10-B9AE-440E-8358-6FF645B5F3C3-199x300.png 199w","sizes":"(max-width: 498px) 100vw, 498px","name":"{EA5DDD10-B9AE-440E-8358-6FF645B5F3C3}","alt":""},{"id":3414,"src":"ht