\u1ea5p","slug":"vai-dui-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-dui-cao-cap\/"},{"id":345,"name":"v\u1ea3i may \u00e1o d\u00e0i","slug":"vai-may-ao-dai","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-may-ao-dai\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;\u00c1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau hoa sen&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=3412","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":2918,"name":"V\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft &#8211; L\u1ee5a Jacquard h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng","slug":"vai-lua-det-hoa-tiet-lua-jacquard-hoa-tiet-trong-dong","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/vai-lua-det-hoa-tiet-lua-jacquard-hoa-tiet-trong-dong\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"358\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"357\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"681\">\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"431\"><strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"372\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc<\/strong>: \u0110a d\u1ea1ng, s\u1eb7c s\u1ee1, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"505\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"447\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/strong>: 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"522\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong>: Kh\u1ed5 v\u1ea3i 115cm, th\u00edch h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 may \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"612\">Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3<\/strong>: gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 ph\u1ea3i ch\u0103ng cho m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<p data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"231\"><strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"231\">V\u1ea3i L\u1ee5a Jacquard H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft Tr\u1ed1ng \u0110\u1ed3ng \u2013 N\u00e9t Tinh Hoa V\u0103n H\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"458\">Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a di s\u1ea3n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t qua t\u1eebng th\u01b0\u1edbc v\u1ea3i Jacquard t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o t\u1eeb Hanhsilk. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u may m\u1eb7c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 t\u00f4n vinh cho l\u1ecbch s\u1eed v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a c\u1ee7a d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"514\"><strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"514\">T\u00ednh N\u0103ng N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt c\u1ee7a V\u1ea3i L\u1ee5a Jacquard Tr\u1ed1ng \u0110\u1ed3ng:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"1214\">\n<li data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"638\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"539\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p:<\/strong> 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, qua qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"839\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"662\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1eb7c s\u1eafc:<\/strong> H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t n\u1ed5i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n v\u1ea3i, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cao m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh chi\u1ebfc tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0110\u00f4ng S\u01a1n &#8211; bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u00e2u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a l\u1ecbch s\u1eed Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"854\">\u0110a d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 may c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1eeb truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, v\u1ea3i Jacquard tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m, \u00e1o vest ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m decor sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1214\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1063\">\u0110\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u cao:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 nhu\u1ed9m ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a v\u1ea3i b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p theo th\u1eddi gian, kh\u00f4ng phai m\u00e0u d\u01b0\u1edbi t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng hay trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh gi\u1eb7t gi\u0169.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1277\"><strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1277\">V\u00ec Sao N\u00ean Ch\u1ecdn V\u1ea3i L\u1ee5a Jacquard Tr\u1ed1ng \u0110\u1ed3ng T\u1ea1i Hanhsilk?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1597\">\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1427\"><strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1295\">S\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u1edbc v\u1ea3i kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1597\"><strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1453\">Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o:<\/strong> Cam k\u1ebft t\u1eeb Hanhsilk v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1ea3i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1edfi c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o m\u1ed7i chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1668\">H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 Hanhsilk c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean phong c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng v\u00e0 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong>. V\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a Jacquard h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch b\u1ea1n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u1edbi v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1978\">\u0110\u1eb7t mua v\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a Jacquard tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ngay h\u00f4m nay t\u1ea1i Hanhsilk \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7n th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed7i m\u1eabu thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec1u tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"650000","regular_price":"650000","sale_price":"650000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">650,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3284,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/26.png.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/26.png-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/