\" data-end=\"1284\">It comes with a <strong data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1208\">waist belt made of handmade brocade fabric by the Muong ethnic group<\/strong>, allowing for adjustable styling and an effortlessly graceful silhouette.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1457\">For a complete and artistic ensemble, the look is best worn with a <strong data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1410\">handmade ceramic accessory by artist Stefania Mairano<\/strong>, blending fashion with timeless craftsmanship.<\/p>","description":"<h3 data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"338\">\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3 <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"336\">V\u00e1y l\u1ee5a Satin 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u2013 \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1eaft vai truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng &amp; \u0111ai th\u1ed5 c\u1ea9m ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"497\">Chi\u1ebfc v\u00e1y l\u1ee5a Satin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c may t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"399\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"443\">\u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1eaft vai truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng<\/strong> \u2013 tinh gi\u1ea3n m\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"667\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"569\">\u0111ai l\u01b0ng b\u1eb1ng v\u1ea3i th\u1ed5 c\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong>, gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u00ecnh v\u00f2ng eo thanh tho\u00e1t, d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c theo nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"862\">Trang ph\u1ee5c tr\u1edf n\u00ean ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"794\">ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n g\u1ed1m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129 Stefania Mairano<\/strong> \u2013 m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea1m s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ea7y tinh t\u1ebf gi\u1eefa th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"10000000","regular_price":"10000000","sale_price":"10000000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">10,000,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3251,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054.jpg 1191w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-212x300.jpg 212w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-724x1024.jpg 724w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-768x1086.jpg 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-1086x1536.jpg 1086w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-8x12.jpg 8w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ecca52e4313301f054-600x848.jpg 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 1191px) 100vw, 1191px","name":"z6787283626235_aad846d3885651ec