parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ao-vay-truyen-thong-traditional-shirt-dress\/","sku":"","short_description":"<h3 data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1040\">\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 <strong data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1038\">Tussah Silk Shirt-Dress with Muong Brocade \u2013 by Italian Designer Malaika Barbara Ebbli<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1204\">Designed by <strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1096\">Italian designer Malaika Barbara Ebbli<\/strong>, this contemporary <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1131\">shirt-dress<\/strong> embraces minimalist elegance while honoring Vietnamese cultural roots.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1523\">Crafted from <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1300\">100% natural Tussah silk handwoven by the Nam Cao Silk Cooperative \u2013 Hanhsilk<\/strong>, the fabric offers a soft, breathable texture with understated luxury. The neckline is delicately adorned with <strong data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1461\">handmade brocade by the Muong ethnic artisans<\/strong>, creating a graceful fusion of heritage and modern fashion.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1666\">Whether worn on its own or styled with accessories, this piece is made for women who value depth, individuality, and timeless sustainability.<\/p>","description":"<h3 data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"371\">\ud83c\uddfb\ud83c\uddf3 <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"369\">\u00c1o v\u00e1y truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng \u2013 L\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p th\u1ed5 c\u1ea9m ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"532\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1edfi <strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"429\">NTK Malaika Barbara Ebbli \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb Italia<\/strong>, m\u1eabu <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"450\">shirt-dress<\/strong> n\u00e0y mang tinh th\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn g\u00ecn gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ecba.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"801\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"635\">l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Tussah 100% d\u1ec7t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c x\u00e3 \u0110\u0169i Nam Cao \u2013 Hanhsilk<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean. Ph\u1ea7n c\u1ed5 \u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1ea5n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"724\">v\u1ea3i th\u1ed5 c\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 h\u00f2a quy\u1ec7n tinh t\u1ebf gi\u1eefa di s\u1ea3n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"932\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p m\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n l\u1ebb ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n, chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p s\u00e2u s\u1eafc, c\u00e1 t\u00ednh v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"12000000","regular_price":"12000000","sale_price":"12000000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">12,000,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3260,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787280887192_a259ebdbe5afabd7681e6297d6ac47f5.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/07\/z6787280887192_a259ebdbe5afabd7681e6297d6ac47f5-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\