":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"C\u00e1c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn","description":"L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn cho &ldquo;D\u00c2Y BU\u1ed8C T\u00d3C T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M &#8211; Silk Scrunchies&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/day-buoc-toc-to-tam-silk-scrunchies\/","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":3040,"name":"\u00c1O L\u1ee4A 2 D\u00c2Y","slug":"ao-lua-2-day","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ao-lua-2-day\/","sku":"","short_description":"<div class=\"product-short-description\">\n<p>\ud83c\udf3f V\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% \u2013 tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9, m\u00e1t l\u00e0nh, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da.<br \/>\n\ud83e\uddf5 Th\u00eau tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u2013 m\u1ed7i b\u00f4ng hoa, c\u00e1nh chim, n\u00e9t r\u1ed3ng ph\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ec1u mang h\u01a1i th\u1edf ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 Nam Cao.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udc57 D\u00e1ng \u00e1o 2 d\u00e2y tr\u1ebb trung \u2013 d\u1ec5 m\u1eb7c, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i, t\u00f4n l\u00ean n\u00e9t n\u1eef t\u00ednh m\u00e0 v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7y ph\u00f3ng kho\u00e1ng.<br \/>\n\ud83d\udccf C\u00f3 \u0111\u1ee7 size v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u m\u1eabu d\u00e1ng \u2013 t\u1eeb \u00e1o ng\u1eafn \u0111\u1ebfn v\u00e1y d\u00e0i, t\u1eeb \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1ea5n nh\u00e1 b\u00e8o nh\u00fan nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>","description":"<p><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn\u00a0s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u2013 N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4, ho\u1eb7c gi\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u (nh\u1ecf 1 \u00edt gi\u1ea5m v\u00e0o n\u01b0\u1edbc gi\u1eb7t cu\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u00e0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m);<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 Kh\u00f4ng gi\u1eb7t chung v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00e1c;<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 Kh\u00f4ng ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi;<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 N\u00ean d\u00f9ng b\u00e0n l\u00e0 h\u01a1i v\u00e0 l\u00e0 \u1ee7i khi c\u00f2n \u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"900000","regular_price":"900000","sale_price":"900000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">900,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3043,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-scaled.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-scaled.png 1810w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-724x1024.png 724w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-768x1086.png 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-1086x1536.png 1086w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-1448x2048.png 1448w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-8x12.png 8w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/3-600x849.png 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 1810px) 100vw, 1810px","name":"3","alt":""},{"id":3044,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/4-scaled.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/4-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/05\/4-scaled.png 1810w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.c