1ebft S\u00f2","slug":"vai-lua-det-hoa-tiet-lua-jacquard-hoa-tiet-so","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/vai-lua-det-hoa-tiet-lua-jacquard-hoa-tiet-so\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"358\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"357\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"681\">\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"431\"><strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"372\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc<\/strong>: \u0110a d\u1ea1ng, s\u1eb7c s\u1ee1, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"505\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"447\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/strong>: 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"599\"><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"522\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong>: Kh\u1ed5 v\u1ea3i 115cm, th\u00edch h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 may \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"612\">Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3<\/strong>: Gi\u00e1 c\u1ea3 ph\u1ea3i ch\u0103ng cho m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"194\"><strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"194\">Kh\u00e1m Ph\u00e1 V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p Ho\u00e0n M\u1ef9 c\u1ee7a L\u1ee5a Jacquard T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m &#8211; Ch\u1ec9 C\u00f3 T\u1ea1i Hanhsilk<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"538\">T\u1ea1i Hanhsilk, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho b\u1ea1n nh\u1eefng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u00f4n vinh v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i. V\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a Jacquard t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m l\u00e0 minh ch\u1ee9ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5t cho s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 d\u1ec7t hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng, t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"586\"><strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"586\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt c\u1ee7a L\u1ee5a Jacquard T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<li data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"691\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"603\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"933\"><strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"707\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Jacquard n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t tinh x\u1ea3o, ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o v\u1ea3i, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 in \u1ea5n hay th\u00eau.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1073\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"962\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n trong nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt m\u1ecdi phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1088\">\u0110a n\u0103ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c sang tr\u1ecdng, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1875\"><strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1680\">\u0110\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng ngay h\u00f4m nay<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t m\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 Hanhsilk m\u1edbi c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mang l\u1ea1i. B\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gh\u00e9 qua showroom c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 sau ho\u1eb7c li\u00ean h\u1ec7 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp qua hotline \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"650000","regular_price":"650000","sale_price":"650000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">650,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3302,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/64.png.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/64.png-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/64.png.png 512w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/64.png-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/64.png-8x12.png 8w","sizes":"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px","name":"64.png","alt":""},{"id":3293,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/11.png.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/11.png-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2025\/02\/11.png.png 512w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/up