ng-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/"}],"tags":[{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":35,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a","slug":"khan-lua","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/khan-lua\/"},{"id":295,"name":"l\u1ee5a jacquard","slug":"lua-jacquard","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-jacquard\/"},{"id":38,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"},{"id":37,"name":"t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/to-tam-100\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft &#8211; Jacquard Scarf&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=2910","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":2861,"name":"Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng: Kh\u0103n hoa Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n, v\u00f2ng l\u1ee5a, d\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c","slug":"set-qua-tang-8-3-khan-hoa-thuy-an-vong-lua-day-buoc-toc-tri-an-phu-nu","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/set-qua-tang-8-3-khan-hoa-thuy-an-vong-lua-day-buoc-toc-tri-an-phu-nu\/","sku":"","short_description":"<h5 data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"498\"><strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"498\">Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 \u2013 N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">&#8211; Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 87*87cm<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">&#8211; V\u00f2ng l\u1ee5a trung<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">&#8211; D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/span><\/p>\n<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u kh\u0103n, m\u00e0u v\u00f2ng l\u1ee5a xin vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>","description":"<h3 data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"498\"><strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"498\">Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 \u2013 N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"578\">M\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"592\">Set bao g\u1ed3m:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"748\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"630\">01 V\u00f2ng l\u1ee5a size Trung (~60cm)<\/strong><br data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\" \/>V\u00f2ng g\u1ed7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ecdc l\u1ee5a th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. Nh\u1eb9, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y, s\u01a1 mi ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"859\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"782\">01 D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong><br data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"785\" \/>M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m g\u00e3y t\u00f3c, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng cho m\u00e1i t\u00f3c m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1104\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"900\">01 Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n 87x87cm<\/strong><br data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\" \/>Nhu\u1ed9m theo k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3n ph\u1ed1i m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n \u2013 kh\u00f4ng chi\u1ebfc n\u00e0o gi\u1ed1ng chi\u1ebfc n\u00e0o. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, l\u00e0m \u00e1o cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9, bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, bu\u1ed9c t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1252\">T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec1u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1148\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong>, ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1edfi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m, tho\u00e1ng, an to\u00e0n cho da v\u00e0 m\u00e1i t\u00f3c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1362\">\ud83d\udc9d Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u01a1ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef \u2013 ho\u1eb7c d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng ch\u00ednh m\u00ecnh nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1413\">\ud83c\udf81 <strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1413\">\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i 8\/3: Gi\u1ea3m ngay 10% cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 Set. (\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 24\/02-08\/03)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Set \u0111\u00e3 bao g\u1ed3m h\u1ed9p v\u00e0 t\u00fai l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng. Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn kh\u0103n v\u00e0 v\u00f2ng vui l\u00f2ng IB ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eafn tin Zalo\/ Hotline: 098 596 98 64<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"880000","regular_price":"880000","sale_price":"880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">880,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2954,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-con