o th\u1eddi gian.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\ud83d\udc9d <strong>L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>L\u00e0m qu\u00e0 bi\u1ebfu sang tr\u1ecdng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n y\u00eau, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 hay \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<li>Th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 k\u00ednh tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\ud83d\udc90 <strong>Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m phong c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n!<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1250000","regular_price":"1250000","sale_price":"1250000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,250,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3075,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e195ac7cf5c403b5ade9bf28b9aa-e1749011169639.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e195ac7cf5c403b5ade9bf28b9aa-e1749011169639-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e195ac7cf5c403b5ade9bf28b9aa-e1749011169639.jpg 1838w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e195ac7cf5c403b5ade9bf28b9aa-e1749011169639-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e195ac7cf5c403b5ade9bf28b9aa-e1749011169639-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/11\/z6380488922303_1b25e19