111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 an t\u00e2m tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho l\u00e0n da nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<p>\ud83d\udca7 <strong>D\u01b0\u1ee1ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1eeb t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean:<\/strong><br \/>\nV\u1edbi h\u00e0m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng protein v\u00e0 axit amin c\u00f3 trong s\u1ee3i l\u1ee5a, kh\u0103n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i m\u00e0 c\u00f2n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n l\u00e0n da, mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb m\u1ecbn m\u00e0ng ch\u1ec9 sau m\u1ed9t th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p>\u2728 <strong>C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>L\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n gi\u00fap lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u1ee5i b\u1ea9n v\u00e0 b\u00e3 nh\u1eddn t\u00edch t\u1ee5 tr\u00ean da.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c da ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o:<\/strong> Nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng l\u1ea5y \u0111i t\u1ebf b\u00e0o ch\u1ebft, mang l\u1ea1i l\u00e0n da t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u01b0\u1ee3t, tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 da nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"850000","regular_price":"850000","sale_price":"850000","price_range":{"min_amount":"850000","max_amount":"1300000"},"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">850,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span> \u2013 <span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,300,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_co