ki\u1ec7n nh\u1ecf g\u1ecdn, ti\u1ec7n d\u1ee5ng, d\u1ec5 c\u1ea5t gi\u1eef. V\u00ec v\u1eady \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mang theo v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 n\u01a1i \u0111\u00e2u. Nh\u01b0 khi b\u1ea1n \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c, \u0111i t\u00e0u xe, m\u00e1y bay mu\u1ed1n ng\u1ee7 m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea5c ng\u1ee7 ng\u1eafn.<\/li>\n<li>D\u00e2y \u0111eo c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 co gi\u00e3n cao ph\u00eda sau c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc t\u1eebng ng\u01b0\u1eddi.<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec1u t\u1ea1i v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng, d\u00f9ng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean \u0111i t\u00e0u xe v\u00e0 m\u00e1y bay&#8230;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:\u00a0<\/strong>22*12cm<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"320000","regular_price":"320000","sale_price":"320000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">320,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2676,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/01\/20220321021652_IMG_0776-1-e1748926499534.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/01\/20220321021652_IMG_0776-1-e1748926499534-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/01\/20220321021652_IMG_0776-1-e1748926499534.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2024\/01\/20220321021652_IMG_0776-1-e1748926499534-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/202