0e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;KH\u0102N \u0110\u0168I T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M NAM&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=2407","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":2309,"name":"G\u1ed0I B\u00cd L\u1ee4A TR\u00d2N","slug":"goi-bi-lua-tron","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/goi-bi-lua-tron\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>G\u1ed1i b\u00ed l\u1ee5a tr\u00f2n trang tr\u00ed ph\u00f2ng kh\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p>H\u00ecnh tr\u00f2n<\/p>\n<p>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng k\u00ednh 45cm, cao 17cm<\/p>\n<p>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: Nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>","description":"<p>G\u1ed1i b\u00ed t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u1edbi ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n xu\u1ea5t \u0111i ch\u00e2u \u00e2u. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng trang tr\u00ed sofa, g\u1ed1i \u00f4m, n\u1eb1m, \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00ean xe \u00f4t\u00f4, ng\u1ed3i&#8230;. L\u00e0m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, gh\u00e9p t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 t\u1eebng m\u1ea3nh v\u1ea3i kh\u00e2u, b\u00f4ng g\u00f2n&#8230;.<\/p>\n<p>Nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc g\u1ed1i b\u00ed l\u1ee5a m\u00e0u s\u1eafc t\u01b0\u01a1i vui, th\u00fa v\u1ecb s\u1ebd mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho t\u1ed5 \u1ea5m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian th\u1eadt xinh \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng!<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"800000","regular_price":"800000","sale_price":"800000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">800,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-c