:"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":131,"name":"kh\u0103n \u0111\u0169i","slug":"khan-dui","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/khan-dui\/"},{"id":56,"name":"lua dui to tam","slug":"lua-dui-to-tam","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-dui-to-tam\/"},{"id":38,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"},{"id":41,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean","slug":"lua-tu-nhien","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-tu-nhien\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;KH\u0102N \u0110\u0168I X\u1ed0P D\u00c0Y &#8211; T\u1eb0M \u0102N L\u00c1 S\u1eaeN&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=2285","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":2264,"name":"VEST BLAZER \u0110\u0168I N\u1eee","slug":"vest-blazer-dui-nu","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/vest-blazer-dui-nu\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p>Bao g\u1ed3m \u00e1o v\u00e0 qu\u1ea7n \u0111\u0169i<\/p>\n<p>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: \u0110\u0169i cao c\u1ea5p<\/p>\n<p>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: Nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u<\/p>\n<p>Ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng: \u0110a d\u1ea1ng ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng<\/p>","description":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m chuy\u1ec3n giao gi\u1eefa hai m\u00f9a thu \u0111\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 coi l\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian tinh t\u1ebf nh\u1ea5t trong n\u0103m. V\u1eady c\u00f2n g\u00ec tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi h\u01a1n khi s\u1eafm cho m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o Blazer nh\u1ec9?<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Hanhsilk gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u b\u1ed9 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o Blazer sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t. B\u1ed9 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o l\u1ee5a bao g\u1ed3m 2 l\u1edbp v\u1ea3i v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i. L\u1edbp v\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ch\u1ed1ng tia UV l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 97%, b\u00ean trong \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec7m l\u1edbp l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u0111\u00f4ng m\u00e1t h\u00e8 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c c\u00f9ng s\u1ef1 t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 trong trang ph\u1ee5c. Kho\u00e1c l\u00ean m\u00ecnh set Blazer n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t t\u1ea1o h\u00ecnh v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u0169ng h\u1ebft s\u1ee9c th\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1ee3ng. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00eau d\u1ec7t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1eeb s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean t\u1ea1i HTX D\u1ec7t \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao &#8211; Th\u00e1i B\u00ecnh, Hanhsilk h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c t\u00f4n vinh v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">B\u1ed9 Blazer nh\u1eadn \u0111\u1eb7t theo s\u1ed1 \u0111o v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng ri\u00eang. Inbox Hanhsilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi gu th\u1eddi trang c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh nh\u1ea5t!<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">L\u01afU \u00dd:<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">*Gi\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh pha lo\u00e3ng<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">*N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 ho\u1eb7c gi\u1eb7t tay \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u01b0\u1eddng, KH\u00d4NG gi\u1eb7t m\u00e1y<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">*Tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"8500000","regular_price":"8500000","sale_price":"8500000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">8,500,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2272,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-scaled.jpg 1709w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-684x1024.jpg 684w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/FEN_1632-768x1150.jpg 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploa