e3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1ea3i c\u1ee7a HTX L\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 L\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao Th\u00e1i B\u00ecnh v\u1edbi 100% t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1ea1t nh\u1eefng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n cao m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u n\u00e0o kh\u00e1c c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c:<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i, nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f9i c\u01a1 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> M\u00e1t m\u1ebb v\u00e0o m\u00f9a h\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u1ea4m \u00e1p v\u00e0o m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/> Gi\u1eb7t d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng, nhanh kh\u00f4 m\u1ecfng nh\u1eb9.<\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u0111\u00fang, v\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a r\u1ea5t b\u1ec1n v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> V\u00ec 100% t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean n\u00ean v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng s\u1ea1ch, c\u00f3 t\u00ednh kh\u00e1ng khu\u1ea9n, ng\u0103n ng\u1eeba k\u00edch \u1ee9ng da \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb nh\u1ecf.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Mang t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o cao.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"250000","regular_price":"250000","sale_price":"250000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">250,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2231,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/11\/z4840750446214_8ecbf1e78bff0000e8750c2491ef0051.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/20