/"},{"id":170,"name":"V\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"vai-lua-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/vai-cao-cap\/vai-lua-cao-cap\/"}],"tags":[{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":184,"name":"mua v\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u","slug":"mua-vai-dui-o-dau","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/mua-vai-dui-o-dau\/"},{"id":182,"name":"v\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i","slug":"vai-dui","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-dui\/"},{"id":181,"name":"v\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"vai-dui-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-dui-cao-cap\/"},{"id":183,"name":"v\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a","slug":"vai-lua","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/vai-lua\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;V\u1ea2I L\u1ee4A D\u1ec6T M\u00c1Y D\u1ec6T M\u1eceNG&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=2229","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":1456,"name":"V\u1ea2I \u0110\u0168I CAO C\u1ea4P &#8211; Tussah Silk Premium","slug":"vai-dui-cao-cap-tussah-silk-premium","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/vai-dui-cao-cap-tussah-silk-premium\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>V\u1ea3i \u0111\u0169i cao c\u1ea5p d\u1ec7t tay t\u1eeb HTX l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao &#8211; Hanhsilk<\/p>\n<p>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ee9ng d\u00e1ng, th\u00f4 \u0111\u0169i<\/p>\n<p>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: Nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u1ed5: 80cm<\/p>\n<p>Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i ghi ch\u00fa S\u0110T ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi Hotline 0985969864 &#8211; 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n<\/p>","description":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<p>V\u1ea3i \u0110\u0169i Cao C\u1ea5p Hanhsilk &#8211; M\u00e1t M\u00f9a H\u00e8, \u1ea4m M\u00f9a \u0110\u00f4ng, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng. May V\u00e1y, Qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o, Blazer &#8211; Suit, Vest Nam&#8230;. Sang tr\u1ecdng, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">V\u1ea3i \u0110\u0169i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 \u0111\u00f4i b\u00e0n tay kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o c\u1ee7a Ngh\u1ec7 Nh\u00e2n HTX L\u1ee5a \u0110\u0169i Nam Cao. Mi\u1ec7t m\u00e0i trong ch\u1eadu n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 k\u00e9o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c 70g &#8211; 100g s\u1ee3i \u0110\u0169i&#8230; Tr\u1ea3i qua tr\u00ean 15 c\u00f4ng \u0111o\u1ea1n v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian t\u1ea1o ra s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb tr\u1ed3ng d\u00e2u, nu\u00f4i t\u1eb1m, d\u1ec7t v\u1ea3i, nhu\u1ed9m m\u00e0u ra v\u1ea3i kho\u1ea3ng 60 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">V\u1ea3i \u0110\u0169i L\u1ee5a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kh\u1ed5 v\u1ea3i: 80cm<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u v\u1ea3i vui l\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i ghi ch\u00fa ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ebfn Hotline: 0985969864 &#8211; 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1ea3i c\u1ee7a HTX L\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 L\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i Nam Cao Th\u00e1i B\u00ecnh v\u1edbi 100% t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1ea1t nh\u1eefng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n cao m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u n\u00e0o kh\u00e1c c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c:<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i, nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f9i c\u01a1 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> M\u00e1t m\u1ebb v\u00e0o m\u00f9a h\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u1ea4m \u00e1p v\u00e0o m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u0111\u00fang, v\u1ea3i l\u1ee5a \u0111\u0169i r\u1ea5t b\u1ec1n v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> V\u00ec 100% t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean n\u00ean v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng s\u1ea1ch, c\u00f3 t\u00ednh kh\u00e1ng khu\u1ea9n, ng\u0103n ng\u1eeba k\u00edch \u1ee9ng da \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb nh\u1ecf.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xhhsvwb xat24cr xgzva0m xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t86\/1.5\/16\/1f4cd.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udccd\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Mang t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o cao.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"950000","regular_price":"950000","sale_price":"950000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">950,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":960,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754.png 927w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-768x770.png 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-600x602.png 600w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/6-e1748926736754-12x12.png 12w","sizes":"(max-width: 927px) 100vw, 927px","name":"6","alt":""},{"id":4215,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-