"name":"\u00c1o d\u00e0i n\u1eef","slug":"ao-dai-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/ao-dai-nu\/"}],"tags":[{"id":119,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i","slug":"ao-dai-dui","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-dui\/"},{"id":120,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m","slug":"ao-dai-dui-to-tam","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-dui-to-tam\/"},{"id":122,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i l\u1ee5a","slug":"ao-dai-lua","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-lua\/"},{"id":121,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m","slug":"ao-dai-lua-to-tam","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-lua-to-tam\/"},{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":38,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"},{"id":37,"name":"t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/to-tam-100\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;\u00c1O D\u00c0I L\u1ee4A \u0110\u0168I TR\u01a0N&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=1394","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":1245,"name":"Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng- Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c da cho ch\u1ecb em","slug":"set-cham-soc-da-tu-to-tam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/set-cham-soc-da-tu-to-tam\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 &#8211; Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c da ch\u1ecb em bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>2 Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u1edbn k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 30*50cm<\/li>\n<li>K\u00e9n Massage da m\u1eb7t 20gr<\/li>\n<li>B\u00f4ng t\u1ea9y trang t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m (d\u00f9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t 8\/3: Gi\u1ea3m ngay 10% cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 Set.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1403\">(\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 24\/02-08\/03)<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"180\">Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 \u2013 Ch\u0103m S\u00f3c Da D\u1ecbu Nh\u1eb9<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"268\">M\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho ch\u1ecb em ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"286\"><strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"286\">Set bao g\u1ed3m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"384\">\n<li data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"317\">\n<p data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"317\">02 Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 30x50cm<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"343\">\n<p data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"343\">01 K\u00e9n massage da m\u1eb7t<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"384\">\n<p data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"384\">01 T\u00fai 6 mi\u1ebfng b\u00f4ng t\u1ea9y trang t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"389\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"426\">\u2728 Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"661\">\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho da.<br data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"491\" \/>Gi\u00fap l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch b\u1ee5i b\u1ea9n, b\u00e3 nh\u1eddn v\u00e0 t\u1ebf b\u00e0o ch\u1ebft nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng. Protein v\u00e0 axit amin t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean trong t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 duy tr\u00ec \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m, gi\u00fap da m\u1ec1m v\u00e0 m\u1ecbn h\u01a1n khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"711\">\n<li data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"686\">\n<p data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"686\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 30x50cm<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"711\">\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"711\">M\u00e0u: Tr\u1eafng, V\u00e0ng kem<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"716\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"742\">\u2728 K\u00e9n massage da m\u1eb7t<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"966\">K\u00e9n t\u1eb1m ch\u1ee9a Protein Sericin t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch s\u00e2u, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n m\u1ee5n \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111en v\u00e0 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111\u00e0n h\u1ed3i da.<br data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"854\" \/>Ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n ng\u00e2m n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1ea5m 2\u20133 ph\u00fat, \u0111eo v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ea7u ng\u00f3n tay v\u00e0 massage nh\u1eb9 3\u20135 ph\u00fat.<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" \/>M\u1ed7i k\u00e9n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng t\u1ed1i \u0111a 2 l\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"971\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1010\">\u2728 B\u00f4ng t\u1ea9y trang t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m (6 mi\u1ebfng)<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1205\">M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch l\u1edbp trang \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 b\u1ee5i b\u1ea9n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m dung d\u1ecbch t\u1ea9y trang.<br data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1098\" \/>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng sinh h\u1ecdc v\u00e0 t\u00e1i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n.<br data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1161\" \/>Th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng, t\u1ef1 ph\u00e2n h\u1ee7y t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1281\">\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1228\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1228\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 8x8cm<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1255\">\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1255\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1281\">\n<p data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1281\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i: 6 mi\u1ebfng\/t\u00fai<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1286\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1403\">\ud83c\udf3f T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1.<br data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1349\" \/>\ud83c\udf81 \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t 8\/3: Gi\u1ea3m ngay 10% cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 Set.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1403\">(\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y 24\/02-08\/03)<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"660000","regular_price":"660000","sale_price":"660000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">660,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":3626,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/10\/z7555790259362_601ede5936560f13709ac767f933f174.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/10\/z7555790259362_601ede5936560f13709ac767f933f174-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/10\/z7555790259362_601ede5936560f13709ac767f933f174.jpg 