escription":"<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u00c1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f4i tay ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n HTX \u0111\u0169i l\u1ee5a Nam Cao k\u00e9o s\u1ee3i, quay t\u01a1, \u0111\u00e1nh \u1ed1ng, d\u1ec7t v\u1ea3i,&#8230; \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ecda l\u00ean theo m\u0169i th\u00eau kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o c\u00f9ng \ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e\u0323\u0302 \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1a\u0323\u0302\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc1a\u0323\ud835\udc28 \ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\u0300\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc21 \ud835\udfd1\ud835\udc03 gi\u00fap l\u1ed9t t\u1ea3 c\u00e1nh hoa m\u1ecfng manh, tinh t\u1ebf, t\u1ecfa s\u00e1ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 d\u01b0\u1edbi tr\u1eddi cu\u1ed1i thu.<\/div>\n<\/div>","description":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u00c1O D\u00c0I \u0110\u0168I T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M TH\u00caU TAY 12 M\u00d9A HOA<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u00c1o d\u00e0i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f4i tay ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n HTX \u0111\u0169i l\u1ee5a Nam Cao k\u00e9o s\u1ee3i, quay t\u01a1, \u0111\u00e1nh \u1ed1ng, d\u1ec7t v\u1ea3i,&#8230; \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ecda l\u00ean theo m\u0169i th\u00eau kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o c\u00f9ng \ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e\u0323\u0302 \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc1a\u0323\u0302\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc1a\u0323\ud835\udc28 \ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\u0300\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc21 \ud835\udfd1\ud835\udc03 gi\u00fap l\u1ed9t t\u1ea3 c\u00e1nh hoa m\u1ecfng manh, tinh t\u1ebf, t\u1ecfa s\u00e1ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 d\u01b0\u1edbi tr\u1eddi cu\u1ed1i thu.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% t\u01a1 \u0111\u0169i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean n\u00ean kh\u00e1ng khu\u1ea9n, b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 da, m\u00e1t m\u00f9a h\u00e8, \u1ea5m m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: \u0110\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: S, M, L ho\u1eb7c may theo s\u1ed1 \u0111o kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng: \u00c1o d\u00e0i xu\u00f4ng ho\u1eb7c theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 33%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-1 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes\/media.php *\/\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/?attachment_id=1179'><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/10\/z4736800746531_739fb431e88717ace26802602587e1a0-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/dt><\/dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/?attachment_id=1178'><img width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/10\/z4736800730636_ac6fbe7a