-dai-lua","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-lua\/"},{"id":121,"name":"\u00e1o d\u00e0i l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m","slug":"ao-dai-lua-to-tam","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/ao-dai-lua-to-tam\/"},{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":38,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"},{"id":37,"name":"t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/to-tam-100\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;\u00c1O D\u00c0I \u0110\u0168I TH\u00caU HOA&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=1170","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":1123,"name":"Ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m","slug":"ruot-goi-to-tam","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ruot-goi-to-tam\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u00f3 m\u00e0u tr\u1eafng, v\u1edbi 2 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn 30*50cm v\u00e0 50*70cm<\/p>\n<p>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m bao g\u1ed3m 1 ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i v\u00e0 1 l\u00f3t g\u1ed1i l\u1ee5a m\u00e0u tr\u1eafng<\/p>","description":"<p>Ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c<\/p>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">1. Ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n gi\u1ea5c ng\u1ee7<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">G\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cao c\u1ea5p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7n nay. Lo\u1ea1i g\u1ed1i n\u00e0y c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00eam \u00e1i v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng. Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 v\u1eady, g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f2n c\u00f3 \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0o m\u00f9a h\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0o m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 gi\u1ea5c ng\u1ee7 s\u00e2u v\u00e0 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng m\u1ea5t ng\u1ee7 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">2. B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00e1i t\u00f3c kh\u1ecfi t\u1ed5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, m\u00e1i t\u00f3c ch\u00fang ta d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb cong v\u00e0 x\u01a1 x\u00e1c sau m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea5c ng\u1ee7 d\u00e0i. L\u00fd do ch\u00ednh d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng n\u00e0y l\u00e0 do g\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u qu\u00e1 c\u1ee9ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ma s\u00e1t t\u1ed5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00f3c. V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, nh\u1eefng s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00e1i t\u00f3c lu\u00f4n s\u00e1ng b\u00f3ng v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i sau m\u1ed9t \u0111\u00eam d\u00e0i say gi\u1ea5c. B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 l\u00e0n da lu\u00f4n m\u1ecbn m\u00e0ng, l\u00e0n da ch\u00fang ta s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac kh\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u v\u1edbi g\u1ed1i n\u1eb1m trong khi ng\u1ee7. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00edch n\u1eb1m s\u1ea5p khi ng\u1ee7 th\u00ec b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac s\u1ebd c\u00e0ng l\u1edbn. N\u1ebfu b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t g\u1ed1i th\u00f4 r\u00e1p s\u1ebd d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng da b\u1ecb k\u00e9o d\u00e3n v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i n\u1ebfp nh\u0103n. Trong khi \u0111\u00f3, g\u1ed1i b\u1eb1ng t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb5n ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p an to\u00e0n t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho l\u00e0n da.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">3. Ru\u1ed9t g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">V\u1edbi g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i lo l\u1eafng v\u1ec1 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng lo\u1ea1i g\u1ed1i n\u00e0y. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ebft, t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9a ch\u1ea5t h\u00f3a h\u1ecdc n\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng lo d\u1ecb \u1ee9ng khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. M\u1eb7t kh\u00e1c, nh\u1eefng s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i n\u00e0y c\u00f2n c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ch\u1ed1ng n\u1ea5m m\u1ed1c, v\u1ebft b\u1ea9n v\u00e0 vi khu\u1ea9n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 v\u1eady, chi\u1ebfc g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f2n gi\u00fap gi\u1eef \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m cho l\u00e0n da r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, c\u00e1c acid amin trong t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u0169ng d\u1ec5 h\u1ea5p th\u1ee5 v\u00e0o da t\u1ea1o l\u1edbp h\u00e0ng r\u00e0o b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 v\u00e0 gi\u1eef \u1ea9m da.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">4.Ng\u0103n t\u0129nh \u0111i\u1ec7n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Theo c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ng\u0103n t\u0129nh \u0111i\u1ec7n v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Do \u0111\u00f3, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng g\u1ed1i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng g\u00e2y c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c b\u00ed b\u00e1ch hay ng\u1ed9t ng\u1ea1t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ngay c\u1ea3 khi th\u1eddi ti\u1ebft oi b\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 v\u1eady, t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u00f2n c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh nhi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u1eb1m duy tr\u00ec \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00e2n nhi\u1ec7t \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1390000","regular_price":"1390000","sale_price":"1390000","price_range":{"min_amount":"1390000","max_amount":"2500000"},"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,390,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span> \u2013 <span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2,500,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":1126,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/09\/z4704251356256_104d764b5e9d1771ea2b528ae6cf1d56-1.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/09\/z4704251356256_104d764b5e9d1771ea2b528ae6cf1d56-1-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/09\/z4704251356256_104d764b5e9d1771ea2b528ae6cf1d56-1.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/09\/z4704251356256_104d764b5e9d1771ea2b528ae6cf1d56-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/09\/z4704251356256_104d764b5e9d1771ea2b528ae6cf1d56-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/