d=\"334\">\n<p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"334\">01 Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a satin<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"358\">\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"358\">01 M\u0169 ng\u1ee7 l\u1ee5a satin<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"388\">\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"388\">01 D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c satin l\u1ee5a<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"153\">\ud83c\udf19 Set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 \u2013 Gi\u1ea5c Ng\u1ee7 L\u1ee5a M\u1ec1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"254\">M\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef bi\u1ebft y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c ch\u00ednh m\u00ecnh \u2013 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb gi\u1ea5c ng\u1ee7.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"272\"><strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"272\">Set bao g\u1ed3m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"388\">\n<li data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"306\">\n<p data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"306\">01 Kh\u0103n b\u1ecbt m\u1eaft ng\u1ee7 l\u1ee5a satin<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"334\">\n<p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"334\">01 Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a satin<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"358\">\n<p data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"358\">01 M\u0169 ng\u1ee7 l\u1ee5a satin<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"388\">\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"388\">01 D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c satin l\u1ee5a<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"393\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"446\">\u2728 L\u1ee5a satin m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn \u2013 n\u00e2ng niu l\u00e0n da &amp; m\u00e1i t\u00f3c<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"518\">T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c may t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a satin b\u00f3ng m\u01b0\u1ee3t, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t tr\u01a1n m\u1ecbn gi\u00fap:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"650\">\n<li data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"557\">\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"557\">Gi\u1ea3m ma s\u00e1t, h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf g\u00e3y r\u1ee5ng t\u00f3c<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"581\">\n<p data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"581\">Gi\u1eef n\u1ebfp t\u00f3c khi ng\u1ee7<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"608\">\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"608\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf in h\u1eb1n tr\u00ean da<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"650\">\n<p data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"650\">Mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9, d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"827\">Kh\u0103n b\u1ecbt m\u1eaft h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u1ea1o kh\u00f4ng gian t\u1ed1i, gi\u00fap th\u01b0 gi\u00e3n s\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<br data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\" \/>M\u0169 ng\u1ee7 v\u00e0 d\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c gi\u1eef t\u00f3c g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i su\u1ed1t \u0111\u00eam.<br data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\" \/>Kh\u1ea9u trang l\u1ee5a \u00eam \u00e1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"929\">\ud83c\udf3f Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh t\u1ebf, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3 cho m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u01a1ng ho\u1eb7c ch\u00ednh b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n b\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"973\">\ud83c\udf81 \u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t: Gi\u1ea3m ngay 10% cho Set.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"930000","regular_price":"930000","sale_price":"930000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","curr