fn s\u1ef1 n\u00e2ng niu, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c qu\u00fd c\u00f4.<\/p>","description":"<p><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn\u00a0s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u2013 N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4, ho\u1eb7c gi\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u (nh\u1ecf 1 \u00edt gi\u1ea5m v\u00e0o n\u01b0\u1edbc gi\u1eb7t cu\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u00e0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m);<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 Kh\u00f4ng gi\u1eb7t chung v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00e1c;<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 Kh\u00f4ng ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi;<\/p>\n<p>\u2013 N\u00ean d\u00f9ng b\u00e0n l\u00e0 h\u01a1i v\u00e0 l\u00e0 \u1ee7i khi c\u00f2n \u1ea9m.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"3500000","regular_price":"3500000","sale_price":"3500000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">3,500,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":798,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/z4562023085248_f93ae95b1186e4423c7bb69fac094df8-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/z4562023085248_f93ae95b1186e4423c7bb69fac094df8-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/z4562023085248_f93ae95b1186e4423c7bb69fac094df8-scaled.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/z4562023085248_f93ae95b1186e4423c7bb69fac094df8-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/08\/z4562023085248_f93ae95b1186e4423c7bb69fac094df8-768x1024.jpg 7