edbc tr\u00ean kh\u0103n m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n \u1ea9m nh\u1ea5t c\u00f3 th\u1ec3, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ecf n\u01b0\u1edbc ra ngo\u00e0i khi\u1ebfn ta kh\u00f3 ch\u1ecbu.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u0110\u1ec3 l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch m\u1eb7t n\u1ea1 t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 d\u01b0\u1edbi v\u00f2i n\u01b0\u1edbc s\u1ea1ch v\u1edbi ch\u00fat gel t\u1eafm c\u1ee7a M\u1ed9c H\u01b0\u01a1ng r\u1ed3i ph\u01a1i kh\u00f4 d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00f3ng r\u00e2m l\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u th\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><strong>M\u1eb7t n\u1ea1 cho da m\u1eb7t:\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: L\u00e0m \u1ea9m m\u1eb7t n\u1ea1 t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/li>\n<li>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Sau b\u01b0\u1edbc l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch m\u1eb7t, x\u1ecbt n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00ean da m\u1eb7t r\u1ed3i \u0111\u1eafp m\u1eb7t n\u1ea1 t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u1ea9m trong 3 ph\u00fat.<\/li>\n<li>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: B\u00f4i d\u1ea7u d\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0111\u1ec3 kho\u00e1 \u1ea9m cho da.<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"130000","regular_price":"130000","sale_price":"130000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">130,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":699,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/121051902_4450491981692680_8285919329462842387_n-1.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/121051902_4450491981692680_8285919329462842387_n-1-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/121051902_4450491981692680_8285919329462842