, \u0111\u1ecf, cam, t\u00edm, \u0111en, tr\u1eafng, m\u00e0u loang t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, gradient..<\/em><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><strong>IB \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u v\u00f2ng<\/strong><\/div>","description":"<h2><strong>Chi ti\u1ebft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00f2ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>V\u00f2ng h\u1ea1t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 pha m\u00e0u kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea5t \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a l\u1ea1i c\u00e0ng l\u00e0m t\u00f4n th\u00eam v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p qu\u00fd ph\u00e1i s\u1eb5n c\u00f3.<\/p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tca\/1.5\/16\/1f339.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf39\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" data-lazy-src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tca\/1.5\/16\/1f339.png\" data-was-processed=\"true\" \/><\/span>\u00a0L\u00e0m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1eb1ng tay n\u00ean m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc v\u00f2ng l\u00e0 DUY NH\u1ea4T<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img class=\"lazyloaded\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tca\/1.5\/16\/1f339.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf39\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" data-lazy-src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tca\/1.5\/16\/1f339.png\" data-was-processed=\"true\" \/><\/span> V\u1ea3i L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Hanhsilk m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ed1t, \u00f3ng \u00e1nh d\u01b0\u1edbi n\u1eafng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5l