":true,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Ng\u1eafn","slug":"Ng\u1eafn"},{"id":0,"name":"Trung","slug":"Trung"},{"id":0,"name":"D\u00e0i","slug":"D\u00e0i"}]}],"variations":[{"id":2894,"attributes":[{"name":"\u0110\u1ed9 d\u00e0i","value":"Ng\u1eafn"}]},{"id":2895,"attributes":[{"name":"\u0110\u1ed9 d\u00e0i","value":"Trung"}]},{"id":2896,"attributes":[{"name":"\u0110\u1ed9 d\u00e0i","value":"D\u00e0i"}]}],"has_options":true,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"C\u00e1c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn","description":"L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn cho &ldquo;V\u00d2NG L\u1ee4A T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/vong-lua\/","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":666,"name":"KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A V\u1ebc HOA","slug":"khan-lua-cao-cap-theu-hoa","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/khan-lua-cao-cap-theu-hoa\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p><em><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u2013 Phong c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 100% s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/li>\n<li>Size: 80x180cm<\/li>\n<li>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd hoa l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong ng\u0103n \u0111\u1ed3 c\u1ee7a ph\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p. B\u1edfi gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e2y kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 gi\u00fap gi\u1eef \u1ea5m c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf trong phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang c\u1ee7a ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef th\u1eddi nay.<\/p>\n<h2><span id=\"Khan_lua_to_tam_nhuom_mau_tu_nhien_Hanhsilk\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p Hanhsilk<\/span><\/h2>\n<p>L\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cao c\u1ea5p l\u00e0m n\u00ean th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Hanhsilk, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a l\u00e0ng d\u1ec7t \u0110\u0169i Nam Cao s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u00e0u nhu\u1ed9m t\u1eeb l\u00e0 b\u00e0ng, tr\u00e0 xanh, c\u1ee7 n\u00e2u v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u lo\u1ea1i v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean kh\u00e1c gi\u00fap cho kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u1ee7a Hanhsilk \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p>Ngo\u00e0i ra, v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n 100%, kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eefng gi\u00fap gi\u1eef \u1ea5m c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 v\u00e0o m\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng m\u00e0 khi kho\u00e1c v\u00e0o m\u00f9a h\u1ea1 hay m\u00f9a thu s\u1ebd cho c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft c\u00e1c d\u00e1ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi. Nh\u1eefng gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean kh\u00e1c nhau t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hanhsilk ngo\u00e0i vi\u1ec7c th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng hay gi\u1eef \u1ea5m c\u01a1 th\u1ec3 th\u00ec c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 handmade tuy\u00eat v\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1c b\u00e0, c\u00e1c m\u1eb9, hay nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n y\u00eau c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2><span id=\"Huong_dan_su_dung_va_bao_quan_khan_lua\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/span><\/h2>\n<p>L\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng lo\u1ea1i v\u1ea3i cao c\u1ea5p, l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i; m\u1ecbn m\u00e0ng v\u00e0 m\u1ecfng manh. N\u00ean trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n n\u00ean l\u01b0u \u00fd c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 sau \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef cho kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 gi\u1eef m\u00e0u l\u00e2u h\u01a1n:<\/p>\n<h3><span id=\"Cach_giat_khan_lua\">C\u00e1ch gi\u1eb7t kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u00e3y n\u00ean gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a. B\u1edfi trong n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1y hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u ch\u1ea5t nh\u01b0 Magie v\u00e0 Canxi. Khi gi\u1eb7t k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1m tr\u1eafng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a. M\u1ea5t th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cho t\u1ea5m kh\u0103n y\u00eau qu\u00fd c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 r\u1ea5t kh\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh bay ch\u00fang.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean gi\u1eb7t kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng m\u00e1y gi\u1eb7t.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eb7t kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u00ec n\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00f3ng s\u1ebd l\u00e0m h\u1ecfng c\u00e1c s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 l\u1ee5a. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u00e3 nhu\u1ed9m l\u00ean kh\u0103n. V\u1eady khi c\u00f3 \u00fd \u0111\u1ecbnh gi\u1eb7t\u00a0kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a\u00a0b\u1ea1n n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eb7t nh\u00e9.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u trong n\u01b0\u1edbc. Khi gi\u1eb7t n\u00ean gi\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00fap gi\u1eef m\u00e0u v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a. N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng. Khi gi\u0169 n\u00ean cho v\u00e0o 1 \u00edt gi\u1ea5m tr\u1eafng v\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc x\u1ea3 v\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u00e0u cho l\u1ee5a c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 gi\u00fap l\u1ee5a b\u1ec1n h\u01a1n.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng gi\u1eb7t kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a chung v\u1edbi c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o v\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i v\u1ea3i kh\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Cach_phoi_khan_lua\">C\u00e1ch ph\u01a1i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eaft h\u1ebft n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e0 gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1edf kh\u0103n. Sau \u0111\u00f3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00f3c \u00e1o v\u00e0 k\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u01a1i l\u00ean.<\/li>\n<li>Ch\u1ecdn n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t m\u1ebb<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Cach_bao_quan_khan_lua\">C\u00e1ch b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>N\u1ebfu s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean th\u00ec kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean g\u1ea5p kh\u0103n m\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n tr\u00ean m\u00f3c. V\u00e0 treo trong t\u1ee7 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o nh\u00e0 b\u1ea1n nh\u01b0 bao b\u1ed9 qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o kh\u00e1c. Tuy nhi\u00ean, n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb 1 t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y s\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 b\u1ecf\u00a0kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a\u00a0v\u00e0o. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap kh\u0103n lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 b\u1ee5i b\u00e1m v\u00e0o.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"1700000","regular_price":"1700000","sale_price":"1700000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1,700,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":4064,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-scaled.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-576x1024.jpg 576w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-768x1365.jpg 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-864x1536.jpg 864w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-7x12.jpg 7w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33-600x1067.jpg 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 1152px) 100vw, 1152px","name":"2aoboqabotget4eqbyznqfhjdoackkpaaw7uhrpc33","alt":""},{"id":4062,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabota94fvv35tfij5uzqinjilj0ggi3f5631-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabota94fvv35tfij5uzqinjilj0ggi3f5631-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabota94fvv35tfij5uzqinjilj0ggi3f5631-scaled.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/2aoboqabota94fvv35tfij5uzqinjilj0ggi3f5631-169x300.jpg 169w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/