7,"name":"Kh\u0103n n\u1eef","slug":"khan-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/khan-nu\/"},{"id":80,"name":"Th\u1eddi trang n\u1eef","slug":"thoi-trang-nu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/danh-muc-san-pham\/thoi-trang-nu\/"}],"tags":[{"id":45,"name":"hanhsilk","slug":"hanhsilk","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/hanhsilk\/"},{"id":131,"name":"kh\u0103n \u0111\u0169i","slug":"khan-dui","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/khan-dui\/"},{"id":140,"name":"kh\u0103n \u0111\u0169i th\u00eau","slug":"khan-dui-theu","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/khan-dui-theu\/"},{"id":35,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a","slug":"khan-lua","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/khan-lua\/"},{"id":38,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":true,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"80*180","slug":"80*180"},{"id":0,"name":"60*180","slug":"60*180"}]}],"variations":[{"id":2890,"attributes":[{"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","value":"60*180"}]},{"id":2889,"attributes":[{"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","value":"80*180"}]}],"has_options":true,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"C\u00e1c t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn","description":"L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn cho &ldquo;KH\u0102N \u0110\u0168I T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/khan-dui-to-tam\/","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":603,"name":"KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A VU\u00d4NG TH\u1ee6Y \u1ea4N","slug":"khan-lua-vuong-thuy-an","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/khan-lua-vuong-thuy-an\/","sku":"","short_description":"<div><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:\u00a0<\/strong>100% L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/div>\n<div><strong>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 85cm x 85cm<\/div>\n<div><strong>K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:\u00a0<\/strong> Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt V\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n<\/div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong> Hanhsilk l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n, kh\u00f4ng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n n\u00e0o gi\u1ed1ng chi\u1ebfc n\u00e0o, n\u00e9t v\u1ebd tay tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 bay b\u1ed5ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda s\u0129 y\u00eau ngh\u1ec1, l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f4ng ty, t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n l\u1edbn t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ngo\u1ea1i giao, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<\/p>\n<p>L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb t\u00ednh c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t v\u1eeba m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng r\u1ea5t d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng, B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp\u00a0l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p.\u00a0\u00a0V\u1edbi B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0y, Hanhsilk mu\u1ed1n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u00e0 l\u1eddi nguy\u1ec7n c\u1ea7u cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef ch\u00fang ta \u2013 m\u1ed9t n\u1eeda c\u1ee7a th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi h\u00e3y s\u1ed1ng m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi th\u1eadt nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea7y ki\u00eau h\u00e3nh v\u00e0 an y\u00ean. H\u00e3y s\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a hoa nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, trong t\u1eebng ph\u00fat gi\u00e2y, trong t\u1eebng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc. V\u00e0 h\u00e3y tin r\u1eb1ng m\u1ed7i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a n\u00f3, m\u1ed7i con ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 duy nh\u1ea5t, v\u00e0 B\u1ea0N l\u00e0 M\u00c0U DUY NH\u1ea4T t\u1ecfa s\u00e1ng gi\u1eefa mu\u00f4n v\u00e0n m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p v\u1ebd, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t, t\u1ea1o v\u00e2n m\u00e0u. C\u00e1c hoa v\u0103n tinh t\u1ebf s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra tr\u00ean gi\u1ea5y khi m\u00e0u m\u1ef1c n\u1ed5i tr\u00ean m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc. \u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh Th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n, c\u00e1c h\u1ecda s\u0129 s\u1ebd th\u1ea3 m\u00e0u tr\u00ean m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc, di chuy\u1ec3n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng c\u00e1c v\u1ec7t m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o c\u00e1c m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 lan t\u1ecfa nh\u01b0 kh\u00f3i. Sau \u0111\u00f3 chuy\u1ec3n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t th\u1ea5m h\u00fat v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh h\u1ed9i t\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ee7 nh\u1eefng t\u1ea7ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u00e0 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc h\u00e0i h\u00f2a.<\/p>\n<div><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n <\/strong>\u00a0l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ng\u00e0n n\u0103m l\u1ecbch s\u1eed. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean\u00a0 nh\u1eefng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang \u0111\u1eadm d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n l\u00e0 v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh nh\u1eefng b\u1ee9c tranh v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng v\u1ebft loang, nh\u1eefng m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u s\u00e1ng t\u1ed1i v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng tinh t\u1ebf t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 mix c\u00f9ng \u00e1o vest, \u00e1o s\u01a1 mi, v\u00e1y \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/div>","description":"<h2>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n Hanhsilk \u2013 Nh\u1eefng b\u1ea3n t\u00ecnh ca c\u1ee7a M\u00e0u s\u1eafc.<\/h2>\n<p>Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n l\u00e0 v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh nh\u1eefng b\u1ee9c tranh v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng v\u1ebft loang, nh\u1eefng m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u s\u00e1ng t\u1ed1i v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng tinh t\u1ebf ..<\/p>\n<div>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n Hanhsilk l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n, kh\u00f4ng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n n\u00e0o gi\u1ed1ng chi\u1ebfc n\u00e0o, n\u00e9t v\u1ebd tay tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 bay b\u1ed5ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda s\u0129 y\u00eau ngh\u1ec1, l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u c\u00f4ng ty, t\u1eadp \u0111o\u00e0n l\u1edbn t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ngo\u1ea1i giao, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<\/div>\n<div>Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ch\u1ecdn ki\u1ec3u, m\u00e0u vui l\u00f2ng ghi l\u1ea1i ch\u00fa th\u00edch ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ed1 Hotline: 0985969864 \u2013 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"550000","regular_price":"550000","sale_price":"550000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">550,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2686,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3.png 1280w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3-600x450.png 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","name":"z5162438140622_83249e78a3494aae8d37bf89f35e5bd3","alt":""},{"id":588,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/6A745B23-1385-4585-B86E-29B2AAA2B6D2-1-scaled.jpeg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/6A745B23-1385-4585-B86E-29B2AAA2B6D2-1-300x300.jpeg","srcset":"https:\/