a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%","slug":"lua-to-tam-100","link":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/tu-khoa-san-pham\/lua-to-tam-100\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"M\u00e0u s\u1eafc","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":true,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Cam xanh","slug":"Cam xanh"},{"id":0,"name":"Xanh tr\u1eafng","slug":"Xanh tr\u1eafng"},{"id":0,"name":"T\u00edm xanh","slug":"T\u00edm xanh"},{"id":0,"name":"Xanh l\u00e1","slug":"Xanh l\u00e1"},{"id":0,"name":"H\u1ed3ng xanh","slug":"H\u1ed3ng xanh"}]}],"variations":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"sold_individually":false,"add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam &ldquo;KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A TH\u1ee6Y \u1ea4N D\u00c0I&rdquo; v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","url":"?add-to-cart=570","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":514,"name":"\u00c1O \u0110\u0168I L\u1ee4A CH\u1ea6N B\u00d4NG","slug":"ao-dui-tran-bong-theu-tay","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ao-dui-tran-bong-theu-tay\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p><strong>\u00c1o n\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p l\u00e2u b\u1ec1n.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Hanhsilk may \u0111o \u00e1o theo s\u1ed1 \u0111o ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>","description":"<h1>\u00c1o ch\u1ea7n b\u00f4ng th\u00eau v\u1ebd l\u00f3t l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h1>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u00c1o ch\u1ea7n b\u00f4ng l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a \u0111\u00f4ng mi\u1ec1n B\u1eafc trong k\u00fd \u1ee9c xa x\u01b0a c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c m\u1eb9, c\u00e1c ch\u1ecb.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o b\u00f4ng ch\u1ea7n tay th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh y\u00eau bao la, l\u00f2ng ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn, s\u1ef1 kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef. M\u1eb7c chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o b\u00f4ng d\u00e0y d\u1eb7n m\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i t\u1eeb b\u00e0n tay c\u1ee7a m\u1eb9, nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi con lu\u00f4n c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y \u1ea5m l\u00f2ng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u00c1o b\u00f4ng ch\u1ea7n tay c\u1ee7a Hanhsilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi 4 m\u00e0u ch\u1ec9, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u nhung the t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 l\u00f3t b\u00ean trong b\u1eb1ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi qu\u1ea7n jean hay v\u00e1y v\u00e0 \u0111i boot \u1ea5m \u0111\u1ec1u tr\u1ebb trung v\u00e0 s\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec7u.<\/div>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":2225,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/07\/317085632_215309787509564_6097508427148037018_n-600x800.jpg 600w","sizes":"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px","name":"317085632_215309