0 T\u1eb0M","slug":"tat-lua-to-tam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/tat-lua-to-tam\/","sku":"","short_description":"<div class=\"product-short-description\">\n<p>T\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a Hanhsilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m l\u1edbn m\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0y mang l\u1ea1i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>","description":"<ul>\n<li><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;- K\u00edch thu\u1edbc: \\n- Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 95% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, 5% thun co gi\u00e3n. T\u1ea5t co d\u00e3n, \u0111i tho\u00e1ng ch\u00e2n, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t, kh\u00f4ng h\u00f4i, kh\u00f4ng b\u00ed m\u00f9i, kh\u00f4ng d\u00e3o r\u00e1ch. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00f4ng \u1ea5m, h\u00e8 m\u00e1t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng quanh n\u0103m v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m m\u00f9i h\u00f4i ch\u00e2n r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15285,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,0],&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng: T\u1ea5t c\u1ed5 cao\/ T\u1ea5t c\u1ed5 ng\u1eafn<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;- K\u00edch thu\u1edbc: \\n- Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 95% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, 5% thun co gi\u00e3n. T\u1ea5t co d\u00e3n, \u0111i tho\u00e1ng ch\u00e2n, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t, kh\u00f4ng h\u00f4i, kh\u00f4ng b\u00ed m\u00f9i, kh\u00f4ng d\u00e3o r\u00e1ch. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00f4ng \u1ea5m, h\u00e8 m\u00e1t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng quanh n\u0103m v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m m\u00f9i h\u00f4i ch\u00e2n r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15285,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,0],&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 95% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, 5% thun co gi\u00e3n<\/span><\/li>\n<li>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: \u0110en, Tr\u1eafng, Ghi, N\u00e2u<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u01a1n v\u1ecb: \u0110\u00f4i<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i<\/h2>\n<p>T\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb 95% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 5% thun \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00fap t\u00ednh co gi\u00e3n t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n. T\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a c\u1ed5 cao c\u00f3 \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1ea5t kh\u00e1c b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a mang l\u1ea1i:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;- K\u00edch thu\u1edbc: \\n- Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 95% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, 5% thun co gi\u00e3n. T\u1ea5t co d\u00e3n, \u0111i tho\u00e1ng ch\u00e2n, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t, kh\u00f4ng h\u00f4i, kh\u00f4ng b\u00ed m\u00f9i, kh\u00f4ng d\u00e3o r\u00e1ch. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00f4ng \u1ea5m, h\u00e8 m\u00e1t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng quanh n\u0103m v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m m\u00f9i h\u00f4i ch\u00e2n r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15285,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,0],&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i\u00a0c\u1ef1c t\u1ed1t<\/span><\/li>\n<li>M\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t. Gi\u1ea3m thi\u1ec3u m\u00f9i h\u00f4i ch\u00e2n t\u1ed1i \u0111a<\/li>\n<li>C\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c khi \u0111i r\u1ea5t tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i. Trong m\u1ecdi m\u00f9a \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i t\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a. M\u00f9a \u0111\u00f4ng \u1ea5m, m\u00f9a h\u00e8 m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng h\u00f4i, kh\u00f4ng nh\u00e3o<\/li>\n<li>Gi\u1eef nhi\u1ec7t t\u1ed1t v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng t\u00edch \u0111i\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u1ea3 nam v\u00e0 n\u1eef. Nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a c