tion":"\u0110\u1ecdc th\u00eam v\u1ec1 &ldquo;S\u01a0 MI \u0110\u0168I NAM D\u00c0I TAY&rdquo;","url":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/so-mi-lua-nam\/","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"extensions":{}},{"id":468,"name":"\u00c1O VEST \u0110\u0168I NAM CAO C\u1ea4P","slug":"ao-vest-lua-cao-cap","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/ao-vest-lua-cao-cap\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u201cv\u0169 tr\u1ee5\u201d veston, c\u00f3 v\u00f4 v\u00e0n nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft \u00e1o vest \u0111\u0169i nam kh\u00e1c nhau. M\u1ed7i m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft l\u1ea1i mang \u0111\u1ebfn n\u00e9t ri\u00eang \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho m\u1ed9t phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/p>\n<p>Hanhsilk may \u0111o vest \u0111\u0169i nam theo s\u1ed1 \u0111o ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>","description":"<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tf4\/1\/16\/2728.png\" alt=\"\u2728\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> B\u1ed8 VEST \u0110\u0168I NAM T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M &#8211; PHONG C\u00c1CH \u0110\u1ec8NH CAO C\u1ee6A S\u1ef0 TINH T\u1ebe <span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tf4\/1\/16\/2728.png\" alt=\"\u2728\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Kho\u00e1c l\u00ean m\u00ecnh b\u1ed9 vest \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1eeb Hanhsilk, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn ngay s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t! S\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng k\u00e9m ph\u1ea7n g\u1ea7n g\u0169i.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t1e\/1\/16\/1f33f.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf3f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> \u0110I\u1ec2M NH\u1ea4N N\u1ed4I B\u1eacT:<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; D\u1ec7t t\u1eeb s\u1ee3i \u0111\u0169i t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 5A cao c\u1ea5p, gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn n\u00e9t m\u1ed9c m\u1ea1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; Khuy s\u1eebng n\u00e2u b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf, sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; May hai l\u1edbp: L\u1edbp ngo\u00e0i l\u00e0 s\u1ee3i \u0111\u0169i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, l\u1edbp trong l\u00e0 l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u01b0\u1ee3t, m\u00e1t l\u1ea1nh.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t6b\/1\/16\/1f454.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udc54\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> M\u1ed7i b\u1ed9 vest t\u1ea1i Hanhsilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/te0\/1\/16\/1f31f.png\" alt=\"\ud83c\udf1f\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> NH\u1eacN \u0110\u1eb6T MAY RI\u00caNG: Theo m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 \u0111o c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ebfc vest \u0111\u1eadm ch\u1ea5t c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a, d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tf4\/1\/16\/2728.png\" alt=\"\u2728\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> M\u1eb8O B\u1ea2O QU\u1ea2N TINH T\u1ebe:<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; Gi\u1eb7t h\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng \u1ea3 c\u1ee7a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; Tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp khi ph\u01a1i, gi\u00fap gi\u1eef v\u1ea3i lu\u00f4n b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">&#8211; L\u00e0 b\u1eb1ng b\u00e0n l\u00e0 h\u01a1i n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u1edbi ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 Silk, \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ed9 vest lu\u00f4n \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t51\/1\/16\/1f449.png\" alt=\"\ud83d\udc49\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" \/><\/span> Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay Hanhsilk \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu b\u1ed9 vest \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 c\