g":"khan-mat-to-tam","parent":0,"type":"variable","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/san-pham\/khan-mat-to-tam\/","sku":"","short_description":"<p>Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/p>\n<p>Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch vui l\u00f2ng IB \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1ec1 th\u00eau t\u00ean b\u00e9 ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eafn tin\/g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n\u00a00985969864- 0977241182 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n.<\/p>","description":"<ul>\n<li><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;- K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:\\n- Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:\\nKh\u0103n m\u1eb7t thu\u1ea7n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean:\\n- D\u1ec7t t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% v\u1edbi m\u00e0u nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n, kh\u00f4ng nhu\u1ed9m ho\u00e1 ch\u1ea5t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi lo\u1ea1i da, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 da em b\u00e9.\\n- Gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean h\u00e0m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng protein v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 m\u1ed9c m\u1ea1c, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a s\u1ee3i t\u01a1; n\u00e2ng niu, c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n l\u00e0n da d\u1ec5 nh\u1eadn th\u1ea5y sau 1 th\u1eddi gian s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng (\u0110\u1eb6C BI\u1ec6T: da d\u1ea7u &amp; da em b\u00e9)\\n- N\u1ed5i b\u1eadt: c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch s\u00e2u, l\u1ea5y \u0111i t\u1ebf b\u00e0o ch\u1ebft v\u00e0 d\u1ea7u th\u1eeba, kh\u00e1ng khu\u1ea9n cao, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, kh\u00f4ng \u1ea9m m\u1ed1c. Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ee9c kho\u1ebb, ch\u1ed1ng l\u00e3o ho\u00e1 da v\u00e0 th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t. \\n\\nT\u00e1i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u00e0m kh\u1eafn r\u1eeda b\u00e1t sau \u0111\u00f3 cho ra \u0111\u1ea5t b\u1ed5 sung protein, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15293,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,0],&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 30 x 30 cm, 30 x 50 cm<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;- K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:\\n- Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:\\nKh\u0103n m\u1eb7t thu\u1ea7n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean:\\n- D\u1ec7t t\u1eeb t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% v\u1edbi m\u00e0u nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n, kh\u00f4ng nhu\u1ed9m ho\u00e1 ch\u1ea5t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi lo\u1ea1i da, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 da em b\u00e9.\\n- Gi\u1eef nguy\u00ean h\u00e0m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng protein v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 m\u1ed9c m\u1ea1c, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a s\u1ee3i t\u01a1; n\u00e2ng niu, c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n l\u00e0n da d\u1ec5 nh\u1eadn th\u1ea5y sau 1 th\u1eddi gian s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng (\u0110\u1eb6C BI\u1ec6T: da d\u1ea7u &amp; da em b\u00e9)\\n- N\u1ed5i b\u1eadt: c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch s\u00e2u, l\u1ea5y \u0111i t\u1ebf b\u00e0o ch\u1ebft v\u00e0 d\u1ea7u th\u1eeba, kh\u00e1ng khu\u1ea9n cao, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, kh\u00f4ng \u1ea9m m\u1ed1c. Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ee9c kho\u1ebb, ch\u1ed1ng l\u00e3o ho\u00e1 da v\u00e0 th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i r\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t. \\n\\nT\u00e1i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u00e0m kh\u1eafn r\u1eeda b\u00e1t sau \u0111\u00f3 cho ra \u0111\u1ea5t b\u1ed5 sung protein, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15293,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:[null,2,0]},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;10&quot;:0,&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:[null,2,0],&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12}\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: T\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean 100%<\/span><\/li>\n<li>M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: Tr\u1eafng, v\u00e0ng kem<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, nguy\u00ean b\u1ea3n t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u00ean qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n an t\u00e2m v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 t\u00ednh an to\u00e0n cho l\u00e0n da.<\/p>\n<p>V\u1edbi h\u00e0m l\u01b0\u1ee3ng protein s\u1eb5n c\u00f3 trong l\u1ee5a c\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng axit amin \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh gi\u00fap cho kh\u0103n m\u1eb7t lu\u00f4n gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u1ed1n c\u00f3. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi c\u00f3 t\u00e1c d\u1ee5ng c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n l\u00e0n da m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% c\u00f3 t\u00e1c d\u1ee5ng l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch b\u1ee5i b\u1ea9n; b\u00e3 nh\u1eddn t\u00edch t\u1ee5 tr\u00ean da m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. L\u1ea5y \u0111i c\u00e1c t\u1ebf b\u00e0o ch\u1ebft c\u00f2n s\u00f3t l\u1ea1i sau m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n r\u1eeda m\u1eb7t t\u1ea9y trang.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"95000","regular_price":"95000","sale_price":"95000","price_range":{"min_amount":"95000","max_amount":"250000"},"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">95,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span> \u2013 <span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">250,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":349,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n-300x300.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n.jpg 414w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/140627085_4910241395717734_2468807549035889815_n