c t\u1ebf khi gh\u00e9 th\u0103m c\u00e1c showroom c\u1ee7a H\u1ea1nh Silk t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p>V\u1edbi nh\u1eefng t\u1ea5m l\u1ee5a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/vi.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Th%E1%BB%83_lo%E1%BA%A1i:Th%E1%BB%A7_c%C3%B4ng\">th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/a>\u00a0100%. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 v\u00e0ng \u00f3ng \u1ea3 c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ecda s\u1ef9 v\u1ebd tay b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u m\u00e0u thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi di\u1ec7n chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf n\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf. M\u1ed7i m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m ra l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m duy nh\u1ea5t, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 c\u00e1i th\u1ee9 2.<\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"2900000","regular_price":"2900000","sale_price":"2900000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":",","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2,900,000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":198,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/1-14-600x399-1.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/1-14-600x399-1-300x300.png","srcset":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/1-14-600x399-1.png 600w, https:\/\/hanhsilk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/1-14-600x399-1-300x200.png 300w","sizes":"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px","name":"1-14-600&#215;399","alt":""},{"id":198,"src":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giahanweb.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/273\/2023\/05\/1-14-600x399-1.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/hanhsilk.giah